It was 93 degrees outside.
外面有93华氏度（约34摄氏度）。

383
00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:19.910
Of course.
当然了。

384
00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:20.370
That day.
那天。

385
00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:20.890
Of course.
当然了。

