387
00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:25.850
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

388
00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.410
In the alley over there.
就在那边的小巷里。

389
00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:27.930
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

390
00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:31.290
