00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:12.010
Angela Kinsey.
Angela Kinsey。

404
00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:12.610
I would.
我会。

405
00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:13.330
Yeah.
没错。

406
00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:13.650
I would.
我会。

