00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:33.950
Here's what I saw in what we're going to call the traditional Christmas.
以下是我在所谓的“传统圣诞节”里看到的。

436
00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:34.550
Okay.
好的。

437
00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:43.550
We saw Christmas lights around the perimeter, like all multicolored lights, a big Christmas tree, a few miniature Christmas trees around the office.
我们看到四周挂着圣诞彩灯，各种颜色的灯，一棵大圣诞树，办公室周围还有几棵迷你圣诞树。

438
00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:52.930
There's garland on the computers, ornaments hanging all over the place, red poinsettia plants, Christmas stockings at reception, a Merry Christmas banner,
电脑上缠着花环，到处挂着装饰品，摆着红色的圣诞红，前台挂着圣诞袜，还有一条“圣诞快乐”的横幅，

439
00:19:53.190 --> 00:20:01.410
and lots of little decorative items like bears with Santa hats and an angel on Pam's desk and a giant nutcracker.
以及许多小装饰品，比如戴着圣诞帽的小熊、Pam 桌上的天使摆件，还有一个巨大的胡桃夹子。

