It was basically a toxic political club used to make others feel miserable and left out.
它基本上就是一个有毒的政治俱乐部，用来让别人感到痛苦和被排挤。

444
00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:18.290
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

445
00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:22.670
Did you notice the giant box that Angela hands Pam?
你注意到 Angela 交给 Pam 的那个大箱子了吗？

446
00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:24.470
She's very sad to hand it over to her.
她交出去的时候非常难过。

447
00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:26.650
The one that Pam throws in the dumpster?
就是 Pam 扔进垃圾桶里的那个？

448
00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:27.110
Yes.
对。

449
00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:30.990
On the side, it says party planning committee, minutes and notes.
侧面写着“派对策划委员会，会议记录和笔记”。

450
00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:32.190
Wow.
哇。

451
00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:35.430
What I would give to read some of those notes.
我真希望能读到那些笔记中的一些内容。

452
00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:45.790
Well, that day that I threw away the box, and I'm wearing a coat, and I'm again pretending like I'm cold, that was the same day that we did the picture outside.
那天我扔掉盒子的时候，我穿着外套，又在假装自己很冷，那正是我们在外面拍照的那一天。

453
00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:47.150
It was 93 degrees.
当时有93华氏度（约34摄氏度）。

454
00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:48.910
We were just a bunch of sweaty folks.
我们当时就是一群汗流浃背的人。

455
00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:53.230
Well, I couldn't help but notice Pam's adorable sweater.
我忍不住注意到了帕姆那件可爱的毛衣。

456
00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:56.850
It's like this cardigan with reindeer and it's kind of a maroonish red.
那是一件印着驯鹿的开衫，颜色是那种暗红色的。

457
00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:57.870
It's so cute.
太可爱了。

